# Code owners for security-sensitive paths (F-077).
#
# Effect today: opening a PR that touches these paths auto-requests review
# from the owner. It is NOT an enforced control until branch protection
# enables "Require review from Code Owners".
#
# DO NOT enable that rule while @idowuseyi is the only account with write
# access — GitHub does not allow approving your own PR, so requiring
# code-owner review would block every PR you open. Turn it on once a second
# reviewer exists, and add them here at the same time.
#
# Note: GitHub silently ignores an owner who lacks write access — a typo here
# produces no error, just no reviewer. Verify on the first PR that the review
# request actually appears.
#
# Last matching pattern wins, so order matters: general first, specific last.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                                   @idowuseyi

